  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/858897/description_1cbdae2f-1bac-4be7-8390-8eb7f9f5473f.png\" alt=\"Creating Space\"></p>\n<h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>描述：</strong></span></h1>\n<h3>《Creating Space》是一款模组，允许你利用机械结构建造火箭并前往其他星球。请准备好以现实科学为灵感设计你的火箭吧。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>从 1.7.10 版本开始，本模组需要搭配 Create 6.0+（或更高版本）。</p>\n<p>本模组与《Create : Interactive》具有一定兼容性，但仅支持 1.7.8 及以上版本。下方附有视频链接，展示了在规避少数已知 bug 后的实际兼容效果。</p>\n<h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>链接：</strong></span></h1>\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/creating-space\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">整合包</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreating-space\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> | <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmGPNKI1yYyWReLQRCG8V4g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YouTube</a> | <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Dn9DhTqarH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> |&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreating-space.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fCreating_Space_Wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:560px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Bam0rIwZjJE\" width=\"560\" height=\"327\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreating-space.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fCreating_Space_Wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vRnG21r4Omk\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></a></h3>\n<h2>来自工程师殖民地团队：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-crowns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowns</a>  </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/ad-astra-creating-space-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra 兼容数据包</a> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/create-creating-space\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方整合包</a></li>\n</ul>",
